{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08892","headline":"秋浦寄内 · 李白","name":"秋浦寄内","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我今寻阳去，辞家千里余。\n结荷倦水宿，却寄大雷书。\n虽不同辛苦，怆离各自居。\n我自入秋浦，三年北信疎。\n红颜愁落尽，白发不能除。\n有客自梁苑，手携五色鱼。\n开鱼得锦字，归问我何如。\n江山虽道阻，意合不爲殊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08892.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08892","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}